        "TileImage": "$($repository 20fe3a6e-2274-4098-9247-91a74c8fe03f).Image",
        "Description": "Client wants to get rid of some of the MPs always walking around the Marrakesh market and consulate. And wants to make it explosive since why is there so much propane around? This aint Texas!\r\rAlso I can&apos;t stand lazy people who just hang out on rooftops all day who are supposed to be working, so one extra target (who may or may not be the actual target, and all the rest are a distraction). Again by explosive accident.\r\rThis should not be that hard.",
